cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Cell-mean fluctuations in an arithmetic convolution field: exact
  Rademacher-null variances and a permutation control
message: >-
  If you use this code or the output committed with it, cite the paper
  and this archive.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Youngrok
    country: KR
abstract: >-
  Reproduction packet for a paper on the fluctuation structure of cell
  means of Z(N) = C(N)/sqrt(V(N)), where C(N) is the convolution of the
  von Mangoldt and Moebius functions. Contains the paper, the fifteen
  scripts it depends on, the output those scripts produced, and a Lean 4
  development in which three of the paper's lemmas are proved. The
  packet is closed under what it consumes: no script reads a file that
  is not present, checked by running every script in dependency order.
keywords:
  - analytic number theory
  - singular series
  - Moebius function
  - variance
  - permutation test
  - Lean
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/soke91/arithmetic-convolution-fields
